{"bankId":"B-MATH-NEW-0101","section":"BAHAGIAN B","domain":"Matematik","authoringType":"NEW_AUTHOR_DEFICIT","reviewStatus":"EDITORIAL_NEW_PENDING_QA","constructFamily":"smallest_addition_to_common_multiple","plannedLevel":3,"question":"Sebanyak 113 pelekat hendak dibahagi sama rata tanpa baki kepada kumpulan berukuran 6, 8 atau 10 pelekat. Berapakah bilangan pelekat paling sedikit yang perlu ditambah supaya ketiga-tiga pembahagian itu boleh dibuat tepat?","options":["7","5","9","12"],"answerIndex":0,"solutionSteps":["KPK bagi 6, 8 dan 10 ialah 120.","120 − 113 = 7 pelekat perlu ditambah."]}
{"bankId":"B-MATH-NEW-0102","section":"BAHAGIAN B","domain":"Matematik","authoringType":"NEW_AUTHOR_DEFICIT","reviewStatus":"EDITORIAL_NEW_PENDING_QA","constructFamily":"identify_number_by_factor_count","plannedLevel":4,"question":"Antara nombor berikut, yang manakah mempunyai tepat 6 faktor positif?","options":["16","28","24","25"],"answerIndex":1,"solutionSteps":["Faktor 28 ialah 1, 2, 4, 7, 14 dan 28, iaitu 6 faktor.","Pilihan lain tidak mempunyai tepat 6 faktor."]}
{"bankId":"B-MATH-NEW-0103","section":"BAHAGIAN B","domain":"Matematik","authoringType":"NEW_AUTHOR_DEFICIT","reviewStatus":"EDITORIAL_NEW_PENDING_QA","constructFamily":"largest_three_digit_multiple_constraints","plannedLevel":3,"question":"Apakah nombor tiga digit terbesar yang boleh dibahagi tepat dengan 12 dan 15?","options":["900","980","960","990"],"answerIndex":2,"solutionSteps":["KPK bagi 12 dan 15 ialah 60.","Gandaan 60 terbesar yang masih tiga digit ialah 60×16 = 960."]}
{"bankId":"B-MATH-NEW-0104","section":"BAHAGIAN B","domain":"Matematik","authoringType":"NEW_AUTHOR_DEFICIT","reviewStatus":"EDITORIAL_NEW_PENDING_QA","constructFamily":"quotient_remainder_reconstruct_then_digit_sum","plannedLevel":4,"question":"Apabila suatu nombor dibahagi dengan 13, hasil bahaginya 27 dan bakinya 8. Berapakah jumlah digit nombor asal itu?","options":["14","16","19","17"],"answerIndex":3,"solutionSteps":["Nombor asal = 13×27 + 8 = 351 + 8 = 359.","Jumlah digit = 3+5+9 = 17."]}
{"bankId":"B-MATH-NEW-0105","section":"BAHAGIAN B","domain":"Matematik","authoringType":"NEW_AUTHOR_DEFICIT","reviewStatus":"EDITORIAL_NEW_PENDING_QA","constructFamily":"fraction_difference_largest_smallest","plannedLevel":3,"question":"Antara 3/4, 5/6, 7/9 dan 2/3, berapakah beza antara pecahan terbesar dengan pecahan terkecil?","options":["1/6","1/12","5/18","1/9"],"answerIndex":0,"solutionSteps":["Pecahan terbesar ialah 5/6 dan yang terkecil ialah 2/3.","5/6 − 2/3 = 5/6 − 4/6 = 1/6."]}
{"bankId":"B-MATH-NEW-0106","section":"BAHAGIAN B","domain":"Matematik","authoringType":"NEW_AUTHOR_DEFICIT","reviewStatus":"EDITORIAL_NEW_PENDING_QA","constructFamily":"fraction_bar_remaining_after_fixed_part","plannedLevel":2,"question":"Rajah menunjukkan 3/10 daripada satu bekalan telah digunakan. Jika 1/5 daripada bekalan asal digunakan lagi, apakah pecahan bekalan asal yang masih tinggal?","options":["2/5","1/2","3/5","7/10"],"answerIndex":1,"solutionSteps":["Jumlah digunakan = 3/10 + 1/5 = 3/10 + 2/10 = 5/10.","Baki = 1 − 5/10 = 1/2."],"visual":{"kind":"fraction_bar","parts":10,"selected":3}}
{"bankId":"B-MATH-NEW-0107","section":"BAHAGIAN B","domain":"Matematik","authoringType":"NEW_AUTHOR_DEFICIT","reviewStatus":"EDITORIAL_NEW_PENDING_QA","constructFamily":"mixed_number_equal_share","plannedLevel":3,"question":"Sebanyak 5 1/4 L minuman dibahagi sama rata ke dalam 7 bekas. Berapakah isi padu setiap bekas?","options":["2/3 L","5/7 L","3/4 L","7/8 L"],"answerIndex":2,"solutionSteps":["5 1/4 = 21/4 L.","21/4 ÷ 7 = 21/28 = 3/4 L."]}
{"bankId":"B-MATH-NEW-0108","section":"BAHAGIAN B","domain":"Matematik","authoringType":"NEW_AUTHOR_DEFICIT","reviewStatus":"EDITORIAL_NEW_PENDING_QA","constructFamily":"fraction_of_fraction_quantity","plannedLevel":4,"question":"Sebuah stor mempunyai 360 kotak. Sebanyak 5/6 daripadanya dihantar, dan 2/5 daripada kotak yang dihantar pergi ke Sekolah A. Berapa kotak dihantar ke Sekolah A?","options":["100","144","180","120"],"answerIndex":3,"solutionSteps":["Kotak dihantar = 5/6 × 360 = 300.","Sekolah A menerima 2/5 × 300 = 120 kotak."]}
{"bankId":"B-MATH-NEW-0109","section":"BAHAGIAN B","domain":"Matematik","authoringType":"NEW_AUTHOR_DEFICIT","reviewStatus":"EDITORIAL_NEW_PENDING_QA","constructFamily":"percentage_points_change","plannedLevel":2,"question":"Kadar kehadiran meningkat daripada 72% kepada 84%. Berapakah peningkatan dalam mata peratusan?","options":["12 mata peratusan","10 mata peratusan","14 mata peratusan","16 mata peratusan"],"answerIndex":0,"solutionSteps":["Peningkatan mata peratusan ialah beza terus antara dua kadar.","84 − 72 = 12 mata peratusan."]}
{"bankId":"B-MATH-NEW-0110","section":"BAHAGIAN B","domain":"Matematik","authoringType":"NEW_AUTHOR_DEFICIT","reviewStatus":"EDITORIAL_NEW_PENDING_QA","constructFamily":"percentage_original_after_decrease","plannedLevel":3,"question":"Selepas berkurang 25%, bilangan buku di satu rak menjadi 90. Berapakah bilangan buku asal?","options":["110","120","125","135"],"answerIndex":1,"solutionSteps":["Selepas berkurang 25%, baki ialah 75% daripada jumlah asal.","Jumlah asal = 90 ÷ 0.75 = 120."]}
{"bankId":"B-MATH-NEW-0111","section":"BAHAGIAN B","domain":"Matematik","authoringType":"NEW_AUTHOR_DEFICIT","reviewStatus":"EDITORIAL_NEW_PENDING_QA","constructFamily":"percentage_then_fraction_of_remainder","plannedLevel":4,"question":"Sebuah tabung mempunyai RM500. Sebanyak 30% digunakan untuk membeli bahan. Kemudian 2/7 daripada baki digunakan untuk pengangkutan. Berapakah baki akhir?","options":["RM230","RM280","RM250","RM300"],"answerIndex":2,"solutionSteps":["Selepas beli bahan, baki = 70%×RM500 = RM350.","Pengangkutan = 2/7×RM350 = RM100; baki akhir = RM250."]}
{"bankId":"B-MATH-NEW-0112","section":"BAHAGIAN B","domain":"Matematik","authoringType":"NEW_AUTHOR_DEFICIT","reviewStatus":"EDITORIAL_NEW_PENDING_QA","constructFamily":"ratio_part_plus_fixed_total","plannedLevel":3,"question":"Nisbah buku fiksyen kepada bukan fiksyen ialah 4:3. Selepas 21 buku bukan fiksyen ditambah, jumlah buku menjadi 126. Berapa buku fiksyen pada asalnya?","options":["48","56","72","60"],"answerIndex":3,"solutionSteps":["Jumlah asal = 126 − 21 = 105. Tujuh bahagian = 105, jadi 1 bahagian = 15.","Buku fiksyen = 4×15 = 60."]}
{"bankId":"B-MATH-NEW-0113","section":"BAHAGIAN B","domain":"Matematik","authoringType":"NEW_AUTHOR_DEFICIT","reviewStatus":"EDITORIAL_NEW_PENDING_QA","constructFamily":"ratio_fraction_conversion_quantity","plannedLevel":2,"question":"Nisbah murid yang membawa bekal kepada yang membeli makanan ialah 3:2. Jika terdapat 40 murid semuanya, berapa murid membawa bekal?","options":["24","16","20","30"],"answerIndex":0,"solutionSteps":["Jumlah nisbah = 5 bahagian; 1 bahagian = 40÷5 = 8.","Membawa bekal = 3×8 = 24."]}
{"bankId":"B-MATH-NEW-0114","section":"BAHAGIAN B","domain":"Matematik","authoringType":"NEW_AUTHOR_DEFICIT","reviewStatus":"EDITORIAL_NEW_PENDING_QA","constructFamily":"direct_proportion_recipe_servings","plannedLevel":3,"question":"Resipi untuk 8 orang menggunakan 600 g ayam. Berapa gram ayam diperlukan untuk 14 orang pada kadar yang sama?","options":["900 g","1050 g","975 g","1200 g"],"answerIndex":1,"solutionSteps":["Ayam seorang = 600÷8 = 75 g.","Untuk 14 orang: 14×75 = 1050 g."]}
{"bankId":"B-MATH-NEW-0115","section":"BAHAGIAN B","domain":"Matematik","authoringType":"NEW_AUTHOR_DEFICIT","reviewStatus":"EDITORIAL_NEW_PENDING_QA","constructFamily":"mean_after_one_score_corrected","plannedLevel":4,"question":"Purata 6 markah ialah 68. Kemudian didapati satu markah direkod sebagai 54 sedangkan markah sebenar ialah 72. Apakah purata yang betul?","options":["69","70","71","72"],"answerIndex":2,"solutionSteps":["Jumlah rekod lama = 6×68 = 408. Pembetulan menambah 72−54 = 18.","Jumlah betul = 426; purata = 426÷6 = 71."]}
{"bankId":"B-MATH-NEW-0116","section":"BAHAGIAN B","domain":"Matematik","authoringType":"NEW_AUTHOR_DEFICIT","reviewStatus":"EDITORIAL_NEW_PENDING_QA","constructFamily":"missing_value_from_mean_then_range","plannedLevel":4,"question":"Lima nombor ialah 12, 15, 18, 20 dan x. Jika minnya 18, berapakah julat data itu?","options":["10","12","15","13"],"answerIndex":3,"solutionSteps":["Jumlah lima nombor = 5×18 = 90; x = 90−(12+15+18+20)=25.","Julat = 25−12 = 13."]}
{"bankId":"B-MATH-NEW-0117","section":"BAHAGIAN B","domain":"Matematik","authoringType":"NEW_AUTHOR_DEFICIT","reviewStatus":"EDITORIAL_NEW_PENDING_QA","constructFamily":"mean_required_pair_total","plannedLevel":3,"question":"Purata 8 nombor ialah 25. Enam nombor pertama berjumlah 142. Berapakah jumlah dua nombor terakhir?","options":["58","52","62","68"],"answerIndex":0,"solutionSteps":["Jumlah semua 8 nombor = 8×25 = 200.","Jumlah dua nombor terakhir = 200−142 = 58."]}
{"bankId":"B-MATH-NEW-0118","section":"BAHAGIAN B","domain":"Matematik","authoringType":"NEW_AUTHOR_DEFICIT","reviewStatus":"EDITORIAL_NEW_PENDING_QA","constructFamily":"mode_after_removing_one_occurrence","plannedLevel":2,"question":"Rajah data menunjukkan 6, 8, 8, 8, 8, 10, 12. Jika satu nilai 8 dikeluarkan, apakah mod data yang tinggal?","options":["6","8","10","12"],"answerIndex":1,"solutionSteps":["Selepas satu nilai 8 dikeluarkan, nilai 8 masih muncul 3 kali.","Nilai lain hanya muncul sekali, jadi mod kekal 8."],"visual":{"kind":"five_value_data","values":[6,8,8,8,8,10,12]}}
{"bankId":"B-MATH-NEW-0119","section":"BAHAGIAN B","domain":"Matematik","authoringType":"NEW_AUTHOR_DEFICIT","reviewStatus":"EDITORIAL_NEW_PENDING_QA","constructFamily":"rectangle_missing_dimension_from_area","plannedLevel":2,"question":"Sebuah segi empat tepat mempunyai luas 180 cm² dan panjang 15 cm. Berapakah lebarnya?","options":["10 cm","15 cm","12 cm","18 cm"],"answerIndex":2,"solutionSteps":["Luas = panjang × lebar.","Lebar = 180÷15 = 12 cm."]}
{"bankId":"B-MATH-NEW-0120","section":"BAHAGIAN B","domain":"Matematik","authoringType":"NEW_AUTHOR_DEFICIT","reviewStatus":"EDITORIAL_NEW_PENDING_QA","constructFamily":"composite_rectangle_strip_area","plannedLevel":3,"question":"Rajah menunjukkan papan 24 cm × 18 cm. Satu jalur selebar 4 cm dipotong sepanjang keseluruhan sisi 24 cm. Berapakah luas papan yang tinggal?","options":["320 cm²","352 cm²","368 cm²","336 cm²"],"answerIndex":3,"solutionSteps":["Luas asal = 24×18 = 432 cm². Luas jalur = 24×4 = 96 cm².","Luas tinggal = 432−96 = 336 cm²."],"visual":{"kind":"rectangle","length_cm":24,"width_cm":18}}
{"bankId":"B-MATH-NEW-0121","section":"BAHAGIAN B","domain":"Matematik","authoringType":"NEW_AUTHOR_DEFICIT","reviewStatus":"EDITORIAL_NEW_PENDING_QA","constructFamily":"triangle_missing_side_from_perimeter","plannedLevel":2,"question":"Sebuah segi tiga mempunyai perimeter 47 cm. Dua sisinya ialah 15 cm dan 18 cm. Berapakah panjang sisi ketiga?","options":["14 cm","12 cm","16 cm","17 cm"],"answerIndex":0,"solutionSteps":["Jumlah dua sisi = 15+18 = 33 cm.","Sisi ketiga = 47−33 = 14 cm."]}
{"bankId":"B-MATH-NEW-0122","section":"BAHAGIAN B","domain":"Matematik","authoringType":"NEW_AUTHOR_DEFICIT","reviewStatus":"EDITORIAL_NEW_PENDING_QA","constructFamily":"square_area_after_side_increase","plannedLevel":3,"question":"Sebuah petak mempunyai sisi 12 cm. Jika setiap sisi ditambah 3 cm, berapakah pertambahan luas?","options":["72 cm²","81 cm²","90 cm²","99 cm²"],"answerIndex":1,"solutionSteps":["Luas asal = 12² = 144 cm²; luas baharu = 15² = 225 cm².","Pertambahan = 225−144 = 81 cm²."]}
{"bankId":"B-MATH-NEW-0123","section":"BAHAGIAN B","domain":"Matematik","authoringType":"NEW_AUTHOR_DEFICIT","reviewStatus":"EDITORIAL_NEW_PENDING_QA","constructFamily":"cuboid_packing_small_boxes","plannedLevel":4,"question":"Rajah menunjukkan kotak besar berukuran 24 cm × 18 cm × 12 cm. Kotak itu diisi penuh dengan kotak kecil berukuran 6 cm × 3 cm × 4 cm tanpa ruang kosong. Berapa kotak kecil muat?","options":["54","64","72","84"],"answerIndex":2,"solutionSteps":["Bilangan sepanjang tiga dimensi = 24÷6=4, 18÷3=6, 12÷4=3.","Jumlah kotak kecil = 4×6×3 = 72."],"visual":{"kind":"cuboid","length_cm":24,"width_cm":18,"height_cm":12}}
{"bankId":"B-MATH-NEW-0124","section":"BAHAGIAN B","domain":"Matematik","authoringType":"NEW_AUTHOR_DEFICIT","reviewStatus":"EDITORIAL_NEW_PENDING_QA","constructFamily":"water_height_from_volume_base_area","plannedLevel":4,"question":"Sebuah bekas beralas 20 cm × 15 cm diisi dengan 4.5 L air. Berapakah tinggi air?","options":["10 cm","12 cm","18 cm","15 cm"],"answerIndex":3,"solutionSteps":["4.5 L = 4500 cm³. Luas alas = 20×15 = 300 cm².","Tinggi = 4500÷300 = 15 cm."]}
{"bankId":"B-MATH-NEW-0125","section":"BAHAGIAN B","domain":"Matematik","authoringType":"NEW_AUTHOR_DEFICIT","reviewStatus":"EDITORIAL_NEW_PENDING_QA","constructFamily":"elapsed_time_cross_midnight","plannedLevel":3,"question":"Sebuah aktiviti bermula pada 10:35 malam dan tamat pada 1:20 pagi keesokan harinya. Berapakah tempohnya?","options":["2 jam 45 minit","2 jam 35 minit","2 jam 55 minit","3 jam 15 minit"],"answerIndex":0,"solutionSteps":["10:35 malam hingga 12:00 malam = 1 jam 25 minit.","12:00 malam hingga 1:20 pagi = 1 jam 20 minit; jumlah = 2 jam 45 minit."]}
